id: FEND15-4
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: list_limit
target: crates/web/src/list_policy.rs
find: keyed_view(tag, marked.clone(), field, notice).unwrap_or_else(|_| el(tag, marked, vec![]))
replace: { let _ = (field, notice); el(tag, marked, vec![]) }
expect-fail: notice_fallback_keeps_bind_list_on_duplicate_keys
note: Err の代替から data-bind-list を外す（dirty な field が解決できず全再描画になる）
